# Wiki Activity Log Template

Chronological record of what happened and when — ingests, queries, lint passes. Each entry uses a consistent prefix format for parseability with Unix tools.

## Entry Format

```markdown
## [YYYY-MM-DD] action | Entity | Details
```

## Example Entries

```markdown
## [2026-04-09] ingest | example-research-intro.md | Added paper on knowledge management
## [2026-04-10] query | network effects | Synthesized answer from 3 sources
## [2026-04-11] lint | wiki/ | Fixed 2 orphan pages, 1 stale source
```

## Parsing Tips

- `grep "^## \[" log.md | tail -5` - Show last 5 entries
- `grep "ingest" log.md` - Show all ingest operations
- `grep "2026-04" log.md` - Show entries from specific month

The log gives you a timeline of the wiki's evolution and helps the LLM understand what's been done recently.

